    ('gm', '<b>✨ Spells</b> tab: pick a student, then <b>Teach</b> any spell. It appears on their Dice tab with its own dice, ready to cast. <b>Remove</b> takes it away. Tick <b>Announce on the TV</b> for a public moment, or leave it off for secrets. For Expecto Patronum, type their Patronus form first (otter, stag, hare…); it shows on their spell card and on the TV.'),
