    ('p', '<b>Custom spells:</b> at the bottom of the Spells tab, give it a name, icon, mana, type (attack with damage, attack with an effect, check, roll, or no roll), stat and dice. It works exactly like a library spell. To make a custom spell stun or silence, add the status by hand when it hits (see Status effects below).'),
